Hi,

our next OpenPrinting Summit is for now planned to be a joint meeting 
with the April 2012 PWG Meeting (as in 2011) and separate from the Linux 
Foundation Summit. The whole meeting will take place in the week from 
April 23-27, 2012 (probably Tue-Fri, Mon if needed) at Apple in 
Cupertino. Participants of both meetings do not need to move in the 
middle of the week.

I hope to see you all there.

Merry Christmas and happy New Year!

    Till
